          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- The Type II sum [H, (3.9), (5.1)] with `v = 2`:\n`∑_{m odd} (∑_{d > U, d | m} μ(d)) ∑_{n > V odd} Λ(n) e(αmn) η₂(mn/x)`. -/\nnoncomputable def typeII (α x : ℝ) (U V : ℕ) : ℂ :=\n  ∑ m ∈ Icc 1 ⌊x⌋₊, if Odd m then (∑ d ∈ m.divisors.filter (U < ·), (μ d : ℂ)) *\n    ∑ n ∈ Icc 1 ⌊x⌋₊, (if Odd n ∧ V < n then (Λ n : ℂ) * e (α * m * n) *\n      (eta2 (m * n / x) : ℂ) else 0) else 0",
            "line": 95,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.MinorArcs.typeII",
            "lines": [
              95,
              100
            ],
            "conclusion": "`typeII α x U V = Σ_{m odd ≤ x} (Σ_{d|m, d>U} μ(d)) Σ_{n odd, V<n ≤ x} Λ(n) e(αmn) η₂(mn/x)`, i.e. `(1*μ_{>U})(m)` times the inner sum over `n>V`."
          },
